### UPLOAD ONE ITERATION OF DOCUMENT
POST {{baseUrl}}/rag/documents?conversationId=ef0d5982-d526-4062-956c-a1db81ca7d53
Cookie: {{cookie}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=MyBoundary

--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="prot.docx"
Content-Type: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document

< ./prot.docx
--MyBoundary--

### Get Document upload status
GET {{baseUrl}}/rag/documents/29329aa6-7c2f-4460-8445-246ac67a9d05
Cookie: {{cookie}}


### Retrieve argument
GET {{baseUrl}}/rag/search?query=Fatecard
Cookie: {{cookie}}


### QUTA
GET {{baseUrl}}/usage
Cookie: {{cookie}}


### DOCUMENT: generate. "type" is assessment (default), homework, lesson_plan, course_syllabus or group_work; header and theme are optional
# @name document
POST {{baseUrl}}/documents
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{cookie}}

{
    "type": "assessment",
    "prompt": "Prova de Ciências para o 6º ano sobre o sistema solar: 4 questões objetivas de 1 ponto e 2 dissertativas de 3 pontos.",
    "header": {
        "institutionName": "Escola Exemplo",
        "teacherName": "Prof. Exemplo",
        "subject": "Ciências"
    },
    "theme": {
        "accentColor": "#1d4ed8"
    }
}

### DOCUMENT: stored JSON (includes the type)
@documentId = {{document.response.body.id}}
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/{{documentId}}
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### DOCUMENT: HTML preview
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/{{documentId}}/preview
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### DOCUMENT: PDF
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/{{documentId}}/pdf
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### DOCUMENT: answer key PDF (400 for types without an answer key: lesson_plan, course_syllabus)
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/{{documentId}}/answer-key
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### DOCUMENT: answer key HTML preview
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/{{documentId}}/answer-key/preview
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### DOCUMENT: manual patch (no AI). "version" is the one from the last response; ids come from the stored JSON
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/documents/{{documentId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{cookie}}

{
    "version": 1,
    "ops": [
        { "op": "set_title", "title": "Prova Bimestral de Ciências" },
        { "op": "update_theme", "theme": { "baseFontSizePt": 14, "numbering": "continuous" } },
        { "op": "update_header_fields", "fields": { "score": false } }
    ]
}

### DOCUMENT: AI revision (the AI returns a patch)
POST {{baseUrl}}/documents/{{documentId}}/revise
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{cookie}}

{
    "version": 2,
    "instruction": "Adicione mais uma questão objetiva de 1 ponto sobre a Lua no final da primeira seção."
}

### DOCUMENT: regenerate the content (keeps header and theme; "prompt" is optional).
# The chat is read as it was when the document was created; "refreshContext": true reads it as it is now.
POST {{baseUrl}}/documents/{{documentId}}/regenerate
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{cookie}}

{
    "version": 3,
    "refreshContext": false
}

### DOCUMENT: generate from a chat. Put the id of a conversation you already talked in here.
# The model reads the conversation (and its uploaded documents); the chat gets a USER + IA message about it.
# With no subject anywhere the answer is 422 { "code": "NEEDS_CLARIFICATION", "question": "..." }.
@chatConversationId = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000
POST {{baseUrl}}/documents
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{cookie}}

{
    "type": "assessment",
    "prompt": "Com base na conversa, crie a prova",
    "conversationId": "{{chatConversationId}}"
}

### HOMEWORK: generate (blocks: questions, text, list, code; header has no score field)
# @name homework
POST {{baseUrl}}/documents
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{cookie}}

{
    "type": "homework",
    "prompt": "Lição de casa de Matemática para o 7º ano sobre equações do 1º grau: 5 exercícios de 2 pontos.",
    "header": { "subject": "Matemática" }
}

### LESSON PLAN: generate (blocks: text, list, table; no student fields, no answer key; "extra" adds labelled header values)
# @name lessonPlan
POST {{baseUrl}}/documents
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{cookie}}

{
    "type": "lesson_plan",
    "prompt": "Plano de aula de 50 minutos sobre frações equivalentes para o 6º ano.",
    "header": {
        "institutionName": "Escola Exemplo",
        "teacherName": "Prof. Exemplo",
        "className": "6º A",
        "extra": [{ "label": "Duração", "value": "50 min" }]
    }
}

### LESSON PLAN: preview
@lessonPlanId = {{lessonPlan.response.body.id}}
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/{{lessonPlanId}}/preview
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### COURSE SYLLABUS: generate
# @name courseSyllabus
POST {{baseUrl}}/documents
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{cookie}}

{
    "type": "course_syllabus",
    "prompt": "Plano de ensino de Programação Orientada a Objetos para o 2º semestre, 60 horas, 18 semanas.",
    "header": { "extra": [{ "label": "Carga horária", "value": "60 h" }, { "label": "Período", "value": "2026/2" }] }
}

### GROUP WORK: generate (blocks: text, list, table, research_task, deliverable, rubric; the rubric gives the value)
# @name groupWork
POST {{baseUrl}}/documents
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{cookie}}

{
    "type": "group_work",
    "prompt": "Trabalho em grupo de Geografia para o 8º ano sobre a distribuição da água no Brasil: grupos de 4, entrega de um relatório escrito, vale 10 pontos.",
    "header": { "subject": "Geografia", "className": "8º A" }
}

### GROUP WORK: correction guide (expected findings, expected outline, grading guidance)
@groupWorkId = {{groupWork.response.body.id}}
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/{{groupWorkId}}/answer-key/preview
Cookie: {{cookie}}
